---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
---
{% from "components.njk" import storyCard %}
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">故事 × 术语 × 实例</p><h1>用场景故事，<br>读懂投资与保障。</h1><p class="hero-lead">给有一点投资经验的你：从工资、房子与市场的日常选择出发，把金融概念讲成人话。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#series">从你的场景开始</a><a class="button secondary" href="{{ '/terms/' | url }}">浏览术语索引</a></div></div><aside class="hero-note"><strong>不是先背定义，而是先听故事。</strong><p>在熟悉的情境里遇见概念，用白话表格拆清机制，再回到实际例子。</p><span class="small">首批 3 系列 · 3 篇完整故事 · 6 篇大纲预告</span></aside></div></section>
<section class="section container" id="series"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">主轴 · 场景系列</p><h2>从你正在经历的事读起</h2></div><span class="small">六个规划场景</span></div><div class="series-grid">{% for series in contentData.series %}<article class="series-card {% if series.stories.length == 0 %}soon{% endif %}"><div class="series-order">{{ '%02d' | format(series.order) }}</div><h3>{% if series.stories.length %}<a href="{{ ('/series/' + series.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ series.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ series.title }}{% endif %}</h3><p>{{ series.summary }}</p><div class="card-bottom">{% if series.stories.length %}<span>{{ series.publishedStories.length }} 篇{{ '理念' if series.format == 'brief' else '故事' }}{% if series.planned %} · 即将上线{% else %} · {{ series.stories.length - series.publishedStories.length }} 篇预告{% endif %}</span><a href="{{ ('/series/' + series.slug + '/') | url }}" aria-label="进入{{ series.title }}系列">进入 →</a>{% else %}<span class="coming-label">即将上线</span>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="tag-shortcuts"><span class="filter-label">从知识域快速进入</span>{% for tag in taxonomy.axes.tags.items %}<a class="chip" href="{{ '/terms/' | url }}?tag={{ tag.id | urlencode }}">{{ tag.id }} →</a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">精选故事</p><h2>先读这一篇</h2></div></div><div class="story-list featured">{% for story in contentData.stories %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endfor %}</div></section>
